[#- DOCS:

- This is for using tlink (aka Title Link)
functionality from inside a template instead
of a content file

- All it does is forwards the ID to the 
"spans/tlink/default.neoj" template

ARGS:

- page_id: The ID of the page to get the title
link for. The page_id can be either a string
or array of spans where the first span is
a plain-text span that has the ID in it

USAGE:

[@- neo.template_link(page_id) -@]

-#]

[!- macro template_tlink(page_id) -!]
[!- set span = page_id -!]
[!- include "spans/tlink/default.neoj" -!]
[!- endmacro -!]
